<% content_for :title, "Import / Export · Railpress" %><h1>Import / Export</h1>
<h2>Content manifest v1</h2><p>Export a bounded JSON manifest of public content or an explicitly selected owner-private snapshot, taxonomy, media references and revision hashes. Media files, menus and redirects are not archive payloads in this version.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Choose and export content manifest", new_admin_export_path %></p>
<h2>Import and complete archives</h2><p>UNSUPPORTED — complete archives, restoration and import belong to M15. A manifest is not a backup. There is no executable upload or import action here.</p>
